World generation

Use Blender as the "editor"

[] Pre-defined object types:
    - Floor: The floor where objects are placed.
    - Camera: The position and direction where the camera is looking at
    - Wizard: Position of where the files Wizzard_4.3d are.

[] Create an exporter for worlds. Can use similar reading format as the 3d object exporter.
    - Should find the object named "floor".
        - Exports:
            - transform (position, scale, rotation)
    - Should find the object named "camera".
        - Exports:
            - transform
            - looking at direction
    - Should find a collection named "wizards"
        - Exports:
            - Array of positions of all the wizards

[] Create an importer based on this kind of file
